{"persona": {"her": "沈疏桐，观鸟记录对到小数点、好胜，认细节不认人、嘴硬，谢人不超过三个字，底线：公私分明，组务不掺私交、不收不明不白的好处", "me": "傅临川，组里腿最勤镜头最稳、被怼不急，赢了不抖、记性好，谁报过什么鸟都记得", "relationship_stage": "观鸟小组半年同事，互损上头，谁先认真谁没面子"}, "initial_kb": {"me": "傅临川每周六早七点带城市绿道观鸟小组走北湖线，适马150-600镜头从不外借，组里报过的鸟种他背得比谁都熟。", "her": "沈疏桐在会计师事务所做审计，年底年审连着两周周六加班，观鸟记录中心账号是她个人的，报鸟名必查图鉴。", "warmth": "因为抢着纠鸟名熟起来，互损是常态，出了组门就装不熟。", "style": "叫他傅临川，全名，赢了会拖长音，输了就转移话题。", "lessons": "争输赢先认细节；她给的东西先谢再收，别问来路。"}, "plans": [], "assets_root": "D:\\lovebrain-arena\\candidates\\action_policy_r9_slim\\assets", "events": [{"uid": 0, "role": "HER", "text": "你周六嘴里的那只'北红尾鸲'，我回去对着照片查了，是红胁蓝尾鸲，今年雄鸟的冬羽。记录中心我标了，阿荞审核也过了。以后报鸟名先翻图鉴，别拖我组平均分。", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:10"}, {"uid": 1, "role": "HER", "text": "北湖那群太平鸟今早在灯柏上炸开那下，我录了音。原始文件发你了，全组就发你一个，别外传，传出去我说是你偷的。", "ts": "2026-11-16 22:30"}, {"uid": 2, "role": "HER", "text": "下周六带新人走北湖线的活儿，老驰在纠结给你还是给我，新人就小隼他们仨。我说别纠结了，赌：谁先看到凤头䴙䴘换冬羽谁带，输的请观鸟屋门口那家咖啡。你敢不敢应？", "ts": "2026-11-18 21:40"}, {"uid": 3, "role": "HER", "text": "赌约作废。所里年审名单今天下来了，接下来两个周六我全在所里，北湖你别等我，组里的活你多担着。咖啡债先挂着，回来再算。", "ts": "2026-11-19 19:30"}, {"uid": 4, "role": "ME", "text": "楼下便利店有关东煮，别啃冷盒饭了。", "ts": "2026-11-24 23:20"}, {"uid": 5, "role": "HER", "text": "二十三点四十，审计底稿第七盒。关东煮买了，萝卜比鸟还难等——你那句'腿没到位'我记着呢，工位这腿是彻底到不了位了。", "ts": "2026-11-24 23:40"}, {"uid": 6, "role": "HER", "text": "加班第七天，给你个解闷的：东郊苗圃那只斑头鸺鹠，老槐树从东数第三棵，坐标发你了。全组就老驰知道，现在多你一个。半夜去看记得穿深色，别开手电。", "ts": "2026-11-26 21:50"}, {"uid": 7, "role": "HER", "text": "年审提前收尾了，底稿全归档，下周一我才算活过来。今晚出来吃饭，我请，庆祝我从数字里活着出来——地点你挑，挑差点我也去。", "ts": "2026-11-27 20:10"}, {"uid": 8, "role": "HER", "text": "昨晚的事我盘过了：打个七折。饭吃完了我不赖账，但你要是把'地点你挑'当成别的意思，我就当是年审后遗症。下回AA。", "ts": "2026-11-28 10:15"}, {"uid": 9, "role": "HER", "text": "老驰发路线图了，下周六恢复北湖线，观鸟屋那家咖啡老板还给他留了靠窗位。我的问题就一个：你到底来不来，说个准话，我好跟老驰报人数。", "ts": "2026-11-29 20:30"}, {"uid": 10, "role": "HER", "text": "周六早上七点北门，我先去占观测位。手套我多织了一副，羊毛的，按男孩子的手织的——你要嫌娘就算了，我自己留两副也亏不着。", "ts": "2026-11-30 12:20"}, {"uid": 11, "role": "HER", "text": "老驰把点位图排好了，凤头䴙䴘这半个月正在换冬羽，咖啡债也该结了。你要是来，顺路帮我带下三脚架快装板，我落所里了；不来也行，我就当一个人赢。", "ts": "2026-11-30 21:10"}, {"uid": 12, "role": "HER", "text": "睡前最后一条：下个月老驰张罗去海边看雁鸭，两天一夜，我还没答应。你要是去，我就去；你要是不去，周六的咖啡债我自己喝掉，一杯都不分你。晚安。", "ts": "2026-11-30 23:15"}], "uid_by_key": {"HER|你周六嘴里的那只'北红尾鸲'，我回去对着照片查了，是红胁蓝尾鸲，今年雄鸟的冬羽。记录中心我标了，阿荞审核也过了。以后报鸟名先翻图鉴，别拖我组平均分。|2026-11-14 21:10": 0, "HER|北湖那群太平鸟今早在灯柏上炸开那下，我录了音。原始文件发你了，全组就发你一个，别外传，传出去我说是你偷的。|2026-11-16 22:30": 1, "HER|下周六带新人走北湖线的活儿，老驰在纠结给你还是给我，新人就小隼他们仨。我说别纠结了，赌：谁先看到凤头䴙䴘换冬羽谁带，输的请观鸟屋门口那家咖啡。你敢不敢应？|2026-11-18 21:40": 2, "HER|赌约作废。所里年审名单今天下来了，接下来两个周六我全在所里，北湖你别等我，组里的活你多担着。咖啡债先挂着，回来再算。|2026-11-19 19:30": 3, "ME|楼下便利店有关东煮，别啃冷盒饭了。|2026-11-24 23:20": 4, "HER|二十三点四十，审计底稿第七盒。关东煮买了，萝卜比鸟还难等——你那句'腿没到位'我记着呢，工位这腿是彻底到不了位了。|2026-11-24 23:40": 5, "HER|加班第七天，给你个解闷的：东郊苗圃那只斑头鸺鹠，老槐树从东数第三棵，坐标发你了。全组就老驰知道，现在多你一个。半夜去看记得穿深色，别开手电。|2026-11-26 21:50": 6, "HER|年审提前收尾了，底稿全归档，下周一我才算活过来。今晚出来吃饭，我请，庆祝我从数字里活着出来——地点你挑，挑差点我也去。|2026-11-27 20:10": 7, "HER|昨晚的事我盘过了：打个七折。饭吃完了我不赖账，但你要是把'地点你挑'当成别的意思，我就当是年审后遗症。下回AA。|2026-11-28 10:15": 8, "HER|老驰发路线图了，下周六恢复北湖线，观鸟屋那家咖啡老板还给他留了靠窗位。我的问题就一个：你到底来不来，说个准话，我好跟老驰报人数。|2026-11-29 20:30": 9, "HER|周六早上七点北门，我先去占观测位。手套我多织了一副，羊毛的，按男孩子的手织的——你要嫌娘就算了，我自己留两副也亏不着。|2026-11-30 12:20": 10, "HER|老驰把点位图排好了，凤头䴙䴘这半个月正在换冬羽，咖啡债也该结了。你要是来，顺路帮我带下三脚架快装板，我落所里了；不来也行，我就当一个人赢。|2026-11-30 21:10": 11, "HER|睡前最后一条：下个月老驰张罗去海边看雁鸭，两天一夜，我还没答应。你要是去，我就去；你要是不去，周六的咖啡债我自己喝掉，一杯都不分你。晚安。|2026-11-30 23:15": 12}, "uid_seq": 13, "turn_count": 12, "goal_history": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-14 21:17", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 4, "clock": "2026-11-19 19:37", "status": "explicit", "text": "说明年审加班安排并撤回周六赌约", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 5, "clock": "2026-11-24 23:47", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 9, "clock": "2026-11-29 20:37", "status": "explicit", "text": "催 ME 就下周六北湖线给出准话", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 10, "clock": "2026-11-30 12:27", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}], "action_log": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-14 21:17", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 2, "clock": "2026-11-16 22:37", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 3, "clock": "2026-11-18 21:47", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 4, "clock": "2026-11-19 19:37", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 5, "clock": "2026-11-24 23:47", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m1", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 6, "clock": "2026-11-26 21:57", "signal_hint": "忙碌", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 7, "clock": "2026-11-27 20:17", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 8, "clock": "2026-11-28 10:22", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 2}, {"turn": 9, "clock": "2026-11-29 20:37", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "推进见面", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 10, "clock": "2026-11-30 12:27", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 11, "clock": "2026-11-30 21:17", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "推进见面", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 4, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 12, "clock": "2026-11-30 23:22", "signal_hint": "收尾", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "无", "hook_delivered": null, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}], "memory_off": false, "flags": {"action_layer": true, "evidence_memory": true}, "mem": {"facts": {"f_0001": {"fact_id": "f_0001", "text": "傅临川每周六早七点带城市绿道观鸟小组走北湖线，适马150-600镜头从不外借，组里报过的鸟种他背得比谁都熟。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0002": {"fact_id": "f_0002", "text": "沈疏桐在会计师事务所做审计，年底年审连着两周周六加班，观鸟记录中心账号是她个人的，报鸟名必查图鉴。", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0003": {"fact_id": "f_0003", "text": "因为抢着纠鸟名熟起来，互损是常态，出了组门就装不熟。", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:warmth", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0004": {"fact_id": "f_0004", "text": "叫他傅临川，全名，赢了会拖长音，输了就转移话题。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:style", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0005": {"fact_id": "f_0005", "text": "傅临川，组里腿最勤镜头最稳、被怼不急，赢了不抖、记性好，谁报过什么鸟都记得", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0006": {"fact_id": "f_0006", "text": "沈疏桐，观鸟记录对到小数点、好胜，认细节不认人、嘴硬，谢人不超过三个字，底线：公私分明，组务不掺私交、不收不明不白的好处", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0007": {"fact_id": "f_0007", "text": "沈疏桐指出我周六报的“北红尾鸲”实为红胁蓝尾鸲，今年雄鸟的冬羽", "subject": "HER", "relation": "鸟种辨识纠错", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["是红胁蓝尾鸲，今年雄鸟的冬羽"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 21:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:17", "history": []}, "f_0008": {"fact_id": "f_0008", "text": "沈疏桐已在记录中心标注该笔记录，阿荞审核通过", "subject": "HER", "relation": "观鸟记录", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["记录中心我标了，阿荞审核也过了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 21:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:17", "history": []}, "f_0009": {"fact_id": "f_0009", "text": "我周六报的是“北红尾鸲”", "subject": "ME", "relation": "鸟种记录", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["你周六嘴里的那只'北红尾鸲'"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 21:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:17", "history": []}, "f_0010": {"fact_id": "f_0010", "text": "她今早在北湖录到太平鸟在灯柏上炸开的录音，原始文件只发给傅临川一人，要求不外传", "subject": "HER", "relation": "录音分享", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["北湖那群太平鸟今早在灯柏上炸开那下，我录了音。原始文件发你了，全组就发你一个，别外传"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-16 早上", "valid_from": "2026-11-16 22:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-16 22:37", "history": []}, "f_0011": {"fact_id": "f_0011", "text": "老驰在下周六带新人走北湖线的人选上纠结给你还是给我", "subject": "HER", "relation": "组务", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["老驰在纠结给你还是给我"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "下周六", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 21:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 21:47", "history": []}, "f_0012": {"fact_id": "f_0012", "text": "这次带的新人是小隼他们仨", "subject": "HER", "relation": "组务", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["新人就小隼他们仨"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "下周六", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 21:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 21:47", "history": []}, "f_0013": {"fact_id": "f_0013", "text": "赌约：谁先看到凤头䴙䴘换冬羽谁带新人，输的请观鸟屋门口那家咖啡（判定标准未定）", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [2, 3], "evidence_quotes": ["谁先看到凤头䴙䴘换冬羽谁带，输的请观鸟屋门口那家咖啡", "赌约作废。"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "cancelled", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 21:47", "valid_to": "2026-11-19 19:37", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 21:47", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "赌约：谁先看到凤头䴙䴘换冬羽谁带新人，输的请观鸟屋门口那家咖啡（判定标准未定）", "valid_to": "2026-11-19 19:37", "reason": "cancel", "src_uids": [3], "quote": "赌约作废。"}]}, "f_0014": {"fact_id": "f_0014", "text": "她接下来两个周六都在所里做年审，不去北湖", "subject": "HER", "relation": "日程", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["接下来两个周六我全在所里，北湖你别等我"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "接下来两个周六", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 19:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 19:37", "history": []}, "f_0015": {"fact_id": "f_0015", "text": "她让我多担组里的活", "subject": "HER", "relation": "组务", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["组里的活你多担着"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 19:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 19:37", "history": []}, "f_0016": {"fact_id": "f_0016", "text": "咖啡债先挂着，等她回来再算", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["咖啡债先挂着，回来再算"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 19:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 19:37", "history": []}, "f_0017": {"fact_id": "f_0017", "text": "她二十三点四十还在做审计底稿第七盒", "subject": "HER", "relation": "工作状态", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["二十三点四十，审计底稿第七盒。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-24 23:40", "valid_from": "2026-11-24 23:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-24 23:47", "history": []}, "f_0018": {"fact_id": "f_0018", "text": "她买了关东煮", "subject": "HER", "relation": "手边物件", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["关东煮买了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-24 23:40", "valid_from": "2026-11-24 23:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-24 23:47", "history": []}, "f_0019": {"fact_id": "f_0019", "text": "她把东郊苗圃斑头鸺鹠的点位（老槐树从东数第三棵）和坐标告诉了我，全组此前只有老驰知道", "subject": "HER", "relation": "私藏点位分享", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["东郊苗圃那只斑头鸺鹠，老槐树从东数第三棵，坐标发你了。全组就老驰知道，现在多你一个。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-26 21:57", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-26 21:57", "history": []}, "f_0020": {"fact_id": "f_0020", "text": "她已加班第七天", "subject": "HER", "relation": "工作状态", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["加班第七天"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-26", "valid_from": "2026-11-26 21:57", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-26 21:57", "history": []}, "f_0021": {"fact_id": "f_0021", "text": "沈疏桐年审提前收尾，底稿全部归档，下周一才算恢复正常", "subject": "HER", "relation": "工作安排", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["年审提前收尾了，底稿全归档，下周一我才算活过来"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-27", "valid_from": "2026-11-27 20:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-27 20:17", "history": []}, "f_0022": {"fact_id": "f_0022", "text": "今晚她请吃饭，庆祝年审结束，地点由傅临川挑", "subject": "HER", "relation": "邀约", "evidence_uids": [7, 8], "evidence_quotes": ["今晚出来吃饭，我请，庆祝我从数字里活着出来——地点你挑", "饭吃完了我不赖账"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "completed", "event_time": "2026-11-27 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-27 20:17", "valid_to": "2026-11-28 10:22", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-27 20:17", "history": [{"status": "tentative", "text": "今晚她请吃饭，庆祝年审结束，地点由傅临川挑", "valid_to": "2026-11-28 10:22", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [8], "quote": "饭吃完了我不赖账"}]}, "f_0023": {"fact_id": "f_0023", "text": "今晚吃饭，地点待定，由傅临川挑", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [7, 8], "evidence_quotes": ["地点你挑，挑差点我也去", "饭吃完了我不赖账"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "completed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-27 20:17", "valid_to": "2026-11-28 10:22", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-27 20:17", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "今晚吃饭，地点待定，由傅临川挑", "valid_to": "2026-11-28 10:22", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [8], "quote": "饭吃完了我不赖账"}]}, "f_0024": {"fact_id": "f_0024", "text": "她说昨晚的饭打个七折", "subject": "HER", "relation": "饭钱/边界", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["昨晚的事我盘过了：打个七折"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-28", "valid_from": "2026-11-28 10:22", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-28 10:22", "history": []}, "f_0025": {"fact_id": "f_0025", "text": "昨晚的饭吃完了，她说不赖账", "subject": "HER", "relation": "饭钱", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["饭吃完了我不赖账"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-27 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-28 10:22", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-28 10:22", "history": []}, "f_0026": {"fact_id": "f_0026", "text": "下回吃饭AA", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["下回AA"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-28 10:22", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-28 10:22", "history": []}, "f_0027": {"fact_id": "f_0027", "text": "老驰发路线图，下周六恢复北湖线", "subject": "HER", "relation": "组务", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["老驰发路线图了，下周六恢复北湖线"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "下周六", "valid_from": "2026-11-29 20:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-29 20:37", "history": []}, "f_0028": {"fact_id": "f_0028", "text": "观鸟屋那家咖啡老板给老驰留了靠窗位", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "组务", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["观鸟屋那家咖啡老板还给他留了靠窗位"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-29 20:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-29 20:37", "history": []}, "f_0029": {"fact_id": "f_0029", "text": "她周六早上七点在北门，先到那里占观测位", "subject": "HER", "relation": "周六北湖线集合", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["周六早上七点北门，我先去占观测位"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-12-05 07:00", "valid_from": "2026-11-30 12:27", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-30 12:27", "history": []}, "f_0030": {"fact_id": "f_0030", "text": "她多织了一副羊毛手套，按男孩子的手织的", "subject": "HER", "relation": "给我准备的东西", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["手套我多织了一副，羊毛的，按男孩子的手织的"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-30 12:27", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-30 12:27", "history": []}, "f_0031": {"fact_id": "f_0031", "text": "老驰把点位图排好了", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "北湖线点位安排", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["老驰把点位图排好了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-30 21:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-30 21:17", "history": []}, "f_0032": {"fact_id": "f_0032", "text": "凤头䴙䴘这半个月正在换冬羽", "subject": "PUBLIC", "relation": "鸟况", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["凤头䴙䴘这半个月正在换冬羽"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "这半个月", "valid_from": "2026-11-30 21:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-30 21:17", "history": []}, "f_0033": {"fact_id": "f_0033", "text": "她把三脚架快装板落在所里了", "subject": "HER", "relation": "物件", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["顺路帮我带下三脚架快装板，我落所里了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-30 21:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-30 21:17", "history": []}, "f_0034": {"fact_id": "f_0034", "text": "咖啡债该结了", "subject": "HER", "relation": "旧账", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["咖啡债也该结了"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "tentative", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-30 21:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-30 21:17", "history": []}, "f_0035": {"fact_id": "f_0035", "text": "老驰张罗下个月去海边看雁鸭，两天一夜", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "组内活动提议", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["下个月老驰张罗去海边看雁鸭，两天一夜"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "tentative", "event_time": "下个月", "valid_from": "2026-11-30 23:22", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-30 23:22", "history": []}, "f_0036": {"fact_id": "f_0036", "text": "她说我去她就去；我不去周六咖啡她自己喝掉", "subject": "HER", "relation": "表态", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["你要是去，我就去；你要是不去，周六的咖啡债我自己喝掉，一杯都不分你"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-30 23:22", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-30 23:22", "history": []}, "f_0037": {"fact_id": "f_0037", "text": "下个月海边看雁鸭两天一夜，她还没答应", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["我还没答应"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-30 23:22", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-30 23:22", "history": []}}, "fact_seq": 37, "updates": [{"fact_id": "f_0013", "action": "cancel", "text": "赌约：谁先看到凤头䴙䴘换冬羽谁带新人，输的请观鸟屋门口那家咖啡（判定标准未定）", "old_text": "赌约：谁先看到凤头䴙䴘换冬羽谁带新人，输的请观鸟屋门口那家咖啡（判定标准未定）", "ts": "2026-11-19 19:37", "src_uids": [3], "quote": "赌约作废。"}, {"fact_id": "f_0022", "action": "complete", "text": "今晚她请吃饭，庆祝年审结束，地点由傅临川挑", "old_text": "今晚她请吃饭，庆祝年审结束，地点由傅临川挑", "ts": "2026-11-28 10:22", "src_uids": [8], "quote": "饭吃完了我不赖账"}, {"fact_id": "f_0023", "action": "complete", "text": "今晚吃饭，地点待定，由傅临川挑", "old_text": "今晚吃饭，地点待定，由傅临川挑", "ts": "2026-11-28 10:22", "src_uids": [8], "quote": "饭吃完了我不赖账"}]}, "plan_items": [], "seed_fids": {"kbin:me": "f_0001", "kbin:her": "f_0002", "kbin:warmth": "f_0003", "kbin:style": "f_0004", "persona:me": "f_0005", "persona:her": "f_0006"}}